{%- comment -%}
PFC Habits: mirrors the web home page's Habits band. Payload (trmnl_home.habits_payload):
title, date, horizon, groups[] {label, logged, count, rows[] {title, state, done}}.
`state` is one of: Logged today / Logged yesterday / Not logged / Automatic.

Each list prints the "Not logged" rows first (they need action), then the rest in
gray. "Not logged" shows as a filled label so it stands out on the wall.
E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles; framework classes only.
{%- endcomment -%}
